| Situation                     | Best Metric           | Reason                          |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Balanced Classes              | Accuracy              | Classes are equally represented |
| Imbalanced Classes            | Precision, Recall, F1 | Accuracy becomes misleading     |
| Fraud Detection               | Recall                | Missing fraud is costly         |
| Spam Detection                | Precision             | False alarms are costly         |
| Medical Diagnosis             | Recall                | Missing disease is dangerous    |
| General Classification        | F1 Score              | Balance of Precision and Recall |
| Probability Output Evaluation | ROC-AUC               | Measures ranking quality        |
| Severe Imbalance              | PR-AUC                | Better than ROC-AUC             |

Regression:

| Situation            | Metric   | Interpretation         |
| -------------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |
| General Regression   | MAE      | Average absolute error |
| Large Errors Matter  | RMSE     | Penalizes big mistakes |
| Business Forecasting | MAPE     | Percentage error       |
| Model Comparison     | R² Score | Variance explained     |
| Robust to Outliers   | MAE      | Less affected          |
